  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "怎么写好 AI Agent Skill 才真正可复用？答案在七个字段里。",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 4.824,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.151,
      "spokenEnd": 4.171,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "OpenAI 将 skill 解释为面向特定任务、可以复用和分享的工作流。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.016,
      "audioStart": 4.157,
      "spokenStart": 4.331,
      "spokenEnd": 8.538,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它可以包含名称、说明、操作步骤和支持资源，让下一次工作不必从空白对话重新开始。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.008,
      "audioStart": 8.481,
      "spokenStart": 8.638,
      "spokenEnd": 14.844,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "常见损失是，你刚做出一份不错的研究简报、项目交接或分析，又得在下周重新说明目标、边界、格式和检查方式。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 9.048,
      "audioStart": 14.849,
      "spokenStart": 15.004,
      "spokenEnd": 23.252,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "真正的工作还没有开始，标准已经变得不一致。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 23.187,
      "spokenStart": 23.352,
      "spokenEnd": 26.099,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这期我们做一张 AI Agent Skill 模板，只有七个字段：触发条件、输入、工作流、输出契约、护栏、证据和修订记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.856,
      "audioStart": 26.096,
      "spokenStart": 26.259,
      "spokenEnd": 34.314,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它足够轻，能被使用；也足够清楚，能被检查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.056,
      "audioStart": 34.251,
      "spokenStart": 34.414,
      "spokenEnd": 37.684,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 37.687,
      "spokenStart": 37.844,
      "spokenEnd": 43.616,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "先从会反复出现的工作开始，而不是从一篇希望别人阅读的说明文开始。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.472,
      "audioStart": 43.639,
      "spokenStart": 43.796,
      "spokenEnd": 48.485,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "先找一个有明确起点的重复任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 48.487,
      "spokenStart": 48.645,
      "spokenEnd": 50.568,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "比如每周有新的客户记录和产品数据进来，需要形成一份支持决策的更新。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.88,
      "audioStart": 50.501,
      "spokenStart": 50.668,
      "spokenEnd": 55.749,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Skill 要写出这个触发条件，而不是笼统地说生成总结。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.008,
      "audioStart": 55.757,
      "spokenStart": 55.909,
      "spokenEnd": 59.124,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "可复用任务的目标是稳定的，哪怕材料每次不同。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.744,
      "audioStart": 59.125,
      "spokenStart": 59.284,
      "spokenEnd": 62.229,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果目标、读者和成功标准次次变化，你拥有的仍是探索，而不是已经可以打包的工作流。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.408,
      "audioStart": 62.224,
      "spokenStart": 62.389,
      "spokenEnd": 68.003,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "不要把经常复制的提示词误当成 Skill。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 68.001,
      "spokenStart": 68.163,
      "spokenEnd": 70.433,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "只有同样的判断、检查和交付形态在多次真实工作里反复出现，这段经验才值得被固化。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.816,
      "audioStart": 70.366,
      "spokenStart": 70.533,
      "spokenEnd": 76.547,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "触发条件可以写得很朴素：当新证据需要被整理成支持决策的更新时，使用这个 Skill。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.24,
      "audioStart": 76.549,
      "spokenStart": 76.707,
      "spokenEnd": 82.144,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这句话能避免把一个好方法误用到相近但不同的任务上。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 82.081,
      "spokenStart": 82.244,
      "spokenEnd": 85.818,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 85.824,
      "spokenStart": 85.978,
      "spokenEnd": 86.654,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，Skill 要解决的是重复工作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.976,
      "audioStart": 86.598,
      "spokenStart": 86.754,
      "spokenEnd": 88.932,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，触发条件要说明何时使用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.904,
      "audioStart": 88.936,
      "spokenStart": 89.092,
      "spokenEnd": 91.197,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，一次探索可以继续留在对话里。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 91.196,
      "spokenStart": 91.357,
      "spokenEnd": 93.82,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Skill 只带回会改变判断的上下文，不把上个项目的一切细节重新塞进来。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.592,
      "audioStart": 93.857,
      "spokenStart": 94,
      "spokenEnd": 98.8,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "接着列出会改变答案的输入。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.4,
      "audioStart": 98.808,
      "spokenStart": 98.96,
      "spokenEnd": 100.542,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "源材料、目标读者、截止时间、授权术语和已有决策可能都重要。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.472,
      "audioStart": 100.476,
      "spokenStart": 100.642,
      "spokenEnd": 105.325,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "上次项目里只是好看的示例，通常并不值得一直带着。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.176,
      "audioStart": 105.329,
      "spokenStart": 105.485,
      "spokenEnd": 108.859,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "资源最好出现在需要它的步骤旁。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.024,
      "audioStart": 108.872,
      "spokenStart": 109.019,
      "spokenEnd": 111.242,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "研究 Skill 可以在取证时给出来源标准，在整理交付时再给出模板。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.28,
      "audioStart": 111.18,
      "spokenStart": 111.342,
      "spokenEnd": 115.818,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这样资源是工作的一部分，而不是一堆没人打开的附件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.008,
      "audioStart": 115.813,
      "spokenStart": 115.978,
      "spokenEnd": 119.18,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "护栏要写成可观察的约束。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.376,
      "audioStart": 119.174,
      "spokenStart": 119.34,
      "spokenEnd": 120.906,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "不要只写小心一点，而要说明哪些事实不能编造、哪份记录最可信、哪类动作必须确认，以及未知情况应该怎样向审阅者展示。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 9.504,
      "audioStart": 120.849,
      "spokenStart": 121.006,
      "spokenEnd": 129.715,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这也是 Skill 和记忆的区别。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.64,
      "audioStart": 129.71,
      "spokenStart": 129.875,
      "spokenEnd": 131.704,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "记忆可以保留一个偏好或旧事实，Skill 则规定要取回什么上下文、怎样使用它，以及发生冲突时下一步该怎么做。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 8.064,
      "audioStart": 131.652,
      "spokenStart": 131.804,
      "spokenEnd": 139.072,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 139.078,
      "spokenStart": 139.232,
      "spokenEnd": 139.916,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，输入说明 Agent 可以依赖什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.336,
      "audioStart": 139.86,
      "spokenStart": 140.016,
      "spokenEnd": 142.549,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，约束说明它必须保护什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.024,
      "audioStart": 142.55,
      "spokenStart": 142.709,
      "spokenEnd": 144.933,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，资源应放在真正需要它的步骤旁。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.384,
      "audioStart": 144.935,
      "spokenStart": 145.093,
      "spokenEnd": 147.676,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Skill 的核心是一组别人能够检查和质疑的判断步骤，而不是一段看起来专业的长文本。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 6.072,
      "audioStart": 147.699,
      "spokenStart": 147.856,
      "spokenEnd": 153.123,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "然后把工作流写成少量判断步骤。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.976,
      "audioStart": 153.127,
      "spokenStart": 153.283,
      "spokenEnd": 155.471,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "先明确目标，检查输入，识别缺口，选择方法，产出草稿，再核验承诺的结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.24,
      "audioStart": 155.411,
      "spokenStart": 155.571,
      "spokenEnd": 161.025,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "每一步都应该让工作状态发生一次可说明的变化。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 161.024,
      "spokenStart": 161.185,
      "spokenEnd": 164.311,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果一个步骤只是重复上一句已经要求的事，就删掉它。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.224,
      "audioStart": 164.309,
      "spokenStart": 164.471,
      "spokenEnd": 167.888,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "如果它改变了证据、选择或交接方式，就把这种变化写清楚。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.896,
      "audioStart": 167.826,
      "spokenStart": 167.988,
      "spokenEnd": 172.076,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "短流程不等于浅，关键是每一步都有作用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.624,
      "audioStart": 172.08,
      "spokenStart": 172.236,
      "spokenEnd": 175.078,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "分支不要写得太多。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.92,
      "audioStart": 175.086,
      "spokenStart": 175.238,
      "spokenEnd": 176.363,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "一个有用的分支是：来源不完整时，先索取缺失记录，并把草稿标记为待确认。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.288,
      "audioStart": 176.293,
      "spokenStart": 176.463,
      "spokenEnd": 181.938,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u03",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "它不需要假装提前预测所有可能发生的例外。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.384,
      "audioStart": 181.879,
      "spokenStart": 182.038,
      "spokenEnd": 184.622,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "风险高的判断一定要有证据动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.88,
      "audioStart": 184.629,
      "spokenStart": 184.782,
      "spokenEnd": 186.866,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Agent 可以列出记录、展示计算、标明假设，或者请求人来决定。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.872,
      "audioStart": 186.803,
      "spokenStart": 186.966,
      "spokenEnd": 191.031,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u03",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "语气再肯定，也不能替代验证。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.76,
      "audioStart": 190.968,
      "spokenStart": 191.131,
      "spokenEnd": 193.085,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 193.091,
      "spokenStart": 193.245,
      "spokenEnd": 193.921,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先区分目标和实现方法。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.88,
      "audioStart": 193.866,
      "spokenStart": 194.021,
      "spokenEnd": 196.117,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，只有真实选择才需要分支。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.12,
      "audioStart": 196.119,
      "spokenStart": 196.277,
      "spokenEnd": 198.619,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，高风险判断要留下证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.048,
      "audioStart": 198.618,
      "spokenStart": 198.779,
      "spokenEnd": 201.012,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "可复用流程应该交出别人能检查、编辑和继续推进的结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.824,
      "audioStart": 201.029,
      "spokenStart": 201.192,
      "spokenEnd": 205.205,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "一个 Skill 的结尾是交接契约。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.616,
      "audioStart": 205.198,
      "spokenStart": 205.365,
      "spokenEnd": 207.172,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "提前说明读者、格式、必填字段和它要支持的决定。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 207.117,
      "spokenStart": 207.272,
      "spokenEnd": 210.885,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这样审阅者不需要倒推原始提示词，也能判断这次结果有没有完成任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.4,
      "audioStart": 210.883,
      "spokenStart": 211.045,
      "spokenEnd": 215.642,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "同时写出未知项规则。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.136,
      "audioStart": 215.642,
      "spokenStart": 215.802,
      "spokenEnd": 217.142,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "缺来源、记录冲突，或者选择取决于人的偏好时，结果都应该直接标出来，不要把它们藏在一段流畅的文字里。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.656,
      "audioStart": 217.154,
      "spokenStart": 217.302,
      "spokenEnd": 224.176,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "最后检查必须贴合工作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.256,
      "audioStart": 224.186,
      "spokenStart": 224.336,
      "spokenEnd": 225.819,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "发布说明要核事实和链接，客户沟通要核读者和权限，计划要核负责人、下一步和未决问题。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.2,
      "audioStart": 225.763,
      "spokenStart": 225.919,
      "spokenEnd": 232.325,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u03",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "不同任务不该共享一份空泛的完成检查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 232.264,
      "spokenStart": 232.425,
      "spokenEnd": 234.922,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这也是 Skill 可以分享的原因。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 234.911,
      "spokenStart": 235.082,
      "spokenEnd": 236.949,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "另一个同事不必猜你的私人直觉，他能查看输入、判断步骤、输出契约和证据，再决定是否接受这次交付。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.752,
      "audioStart": 236.886,
      "spokenStart": 237.049,
      "spokenEnd": 243.992,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 243.998,
      "spokenStart": 244.152,
      "spokenEnd": 244.823,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，执行前先定义交付格式。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.808,
      "audioStart": 244.768,
      "spokenStart": 244.923,
      "spokenEnd": 246.93,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，未知项要显式展示。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.448,
      "audioStart": 246.936,
      "spokenStart": 247.09,
      "spokenEnd": 248.763,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，最后检查必须贴合任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.808,
      "audioStart": 248.768,
      "spokenStart": 248.923,
      "spokenEnd": 250.925,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Skill 是持续维护的资产，应根据失败模式更新，而不是每次顺利完成后随心改写。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 6.144,
      "audioStart": 250.955,
      "spokenStart": 251.105,
      "spokenEnd": 256.454,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "不要在第一次成功后冻结 Skill。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.64,
      "audioStart": 256.453,
      "spokenStart": 256.614,
      "spokenEnd": 258.441,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "应该记录真正促成修订的失败：缺少输入、默认值误导、字段不够、或者看似安心的检查漏掉了关键错误。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.824,
      "audioStart": 258.44,
      "spokenStart": 258.601,
      "spokenEnd": 265.634,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "尽量保持单元小。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.8,
      "audioStart": 265.642,
      "spokenStart": 265.794,
      "spokenEnd": 266.817,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "一个 Skill 收集证据，另一个把证据整理成决策简报，第三个进行发布检查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.424,
      "audioStart": 266.752,
      "spokenStart": 266.917,
      "spokenEnd": 271.532,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "小 Skill 更容易理解、测试，也更容易在新任务里重新组合。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.704,
      "audioStart": 271.535,
      "spokenStart": 271.692,
      "spokenEnd": 275.597,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "修订后要拿到新任务上复测。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.64,
      "audioStart": 275.6,
      "spokenStart": 275.757,
      "spokenEnd": 277.598,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "只回放当初启发你的那个案例，只能证明你记住了过去。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.248,
      "audioStart": 277.536,
      "spokenStart": 277.698,
      "spokenEnd": 281.139,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u03",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "新输入才能暴露这份工作契约是否真的带出了正确的判断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 281.081,
      "spokenStart": 281.239,
      "spokenEnd": 284.989,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当 Skill 变得太长时，问一问哪些内容是真正共享的，哪些应该放进资源、模板或另一个专门的 Skill。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.512,
      "audioStart": 284.991,
      "spokenStart": 285.149,
      "spokenEnd": 291.878,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "目标是可靠指导，不是保存每一次历史教训。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 291.813,
      "spokenStart": 291.978,
      "spokenEnd": 294.729,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 294.735,
      "spokenStart": 294.889,
      "spokenEnd": 295.574,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，用真实失败推动修订。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 295.518,
      "spokenStart": 295.674,
      "spokenEnd": 297.553,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，小 Skill 更容易组合。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.52,
      "audioStart": 297.551,
      "spokenStart": 297.713,
      "spokenEnd": 299.431,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，要用新任务重新验证。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.664,
      "audioStart": 299.433,
      "spokenStart": 299.591,
      "spokenEnd": 301.46,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "现在把模板串起来：捕捉真实重复任务，命名触发条件，带入会改变判断的上下文，写下关键步骤，定义交接结果，再用新任务检查它是否仍然可靠。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 11.208,
      "audioStart": 301.485,
      "spokenStart": 301.64,
      "spokenEnd": 312.051,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这样，AI Agent 就不再只是重复你上一次写得最好的提示词，而是开始使用一套持续维护的工作方法。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.128,
      "audioStart": 312.045,
      "spokenStart": 312.211,
      "spokenEnd": 318.531,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它不会因此绝对正确，但会更容易被检查、改进和复用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.464,
      "audioStart": 318.468,
      "spokenStart": 318.631,
      "spokenEnd": 322.29,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这周就挑一个小而重复的任务试试。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.808,
      "audioStart": 322.287,
      "spokenStart": 322.45,
      "spokenEnd": 324.446,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "用一句话写下触发条件，只放入会改变决定的材料，指定一个审阅者真的能执行的检查，再明确一个 Agent 不该用流畅语言掩盖的未知项。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 9.624,
      "audioStart": 324.384,
      "spokenStart": 324.546,
      "spokenEnd": 333.364,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u03",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "第二次使用顺利，就保留它；如果失败，就只修改真正失败的字段。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.16,
      "audioStart": 333.306,
      "spokenStart": 333.464,
      "spokenEnd": 337.813,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "关注 Tiny Agent，成为更擅长使用 AI 的人！",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 337.805,
      "spokenStart": 337.973,
      "spokenEnd": 340.474,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    }
  ],
